  "bodyHash": "d9d0ac3cfcbd81e2",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>Create: Stuff 'N Additions - 水箱修復</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-stuff-and-addition-tank-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.bypixel.dev/raw/4dlsHJ.png&n=-1\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-and-addition-tank-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/F4MtFnv7/cozy-64h.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/serverside-swzo/Create-Stuff-and-Addition-Tank-Fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/DPnZdBK5/41dfe80a399c0c8466f8cecc9f35048de5066e11-1.png\" alt=\"Github\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fnDhkgzAPR2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg&h=64\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/serverside-swzo/Create-Stuff-and-Addition-Tank-Fix/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/serverside-swzo/Create-Stuff-and-Addition-Tank-Fix.svg\" alt=\"GitHub 問題回報\"></a>\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://ghloc.vercel.app/api/serverside-swzo/Create-Stuff-and-Addition-Tank-Fix/badge&color=2ecc71\" alt=\"程式碼行數\"></p>\n<p>一款簡單的模組，為 NeoForge 1.21.1 修復並新增 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-stuff-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Stuff 'N Additions</a> 水箱的整合功能。</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong>水槽注水：</strong>透過註冊 NeoForge 液體能力來修復 Create: SA 的水箱，使其能夠被 Create 的水槽、管線及其他液體流動方塊填充（每次 1000mb）。</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>熔爐燃料：</strong>燃料水箱（熔岩）現在可作為可重複使用的燃料來源。它們不會瞬間耗盡，而是保留在燃料槽中並「逐刻」減少內部容量。</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>沉浸式飛機整合：</strong>為您的飛機與旋翼機加油！將其放置在飛機的鍋爐／燃料槽即可。</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Sophisticated Core 整合（選配）：</strong>完整支援 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Core</a> 的水箱升級。當安裝 Sophisticated Core 時會自動啟用此功能，讓該升級能在 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-storage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Storage</a> 容器與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a> 內部高速填充和排空 Create: SA 的水箱。</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Curios 水箱欄位：</strong>新增自訂的「Tank」Curios 欄位，允許將 Create: SA 的水箱裝備為飾品（需安裝 Curios）。</p></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>展示</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db633e7972a9ee684a4bb85ab3abe9c3b657ec81.png\" alt=\"功能展示\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/68e434c350da39566bac1255318a3120e5391039.png\" alt=\"水箱升級展示\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dac02291458d81ede84aa927ecbada63f5a1d5ac.png\" alt=\"Curios 欄位\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4e167c50826fa8b727158894f533d49ec1035ca4.png\" alt=\"沉浸式飛機相容性\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d6ffaf453d99f1e5cb1ef6b38c67d8b4c4370727.png\" alt=\"熔爐相容性\"></p>",
